body:
> Hi all! Sorry that I missed this thread before - 147.0 should no longer auto resolve in plan mode at this point. We did have a longer than usual release cycle for the latest CLI and please let me know if you are still seeing the issue. Really appreciate all the feedback!

@shijie-oai you say "in plan mode" which is good to hear but not what we're asking for. We want this off everywhere by default. It is a terrible idea to automatically choose for the user.

If someone wants to run completely unattended and is okay getting back whatever, this should be a separate opt-in configuration, like YOLO mode.
